---

<section class="border-y border-slate-100 bg-white py-4 md:py-6">
  <div class="max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5">
    <div
      class="flex md:grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 md:gap-4 overflow-x-auto snap-x snap-mandatory hide-scrollbar pb-1 md:pb-0 -mx-5 px-5 md:mx-0 md:px-0"
    >
      <div
        class="flex-none w-[70%] sm:w-[50%] md:w-auto snap-center flex items-center gap-3 p-3 md:p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80"
      >
        <div
          class="w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-200/70 text-[#1a3a5c] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-base md:text-lg"
        >
          💳
        </div>
        <div class="text-left">
          <h4
            class="text-[13px] md:text-[13.5px] font-black text-[#1a3a5c] leading-tight"
          >
            Sem cartão de crédito
          </h4>
          <p
            class="hidden md:block text-[12px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5 leading-snug"
          >
            Teste 15 dias grátis sem precisar cadastrar nenhum dado
            financeiro.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="flex-none w-[70%] sm:w-[50%] md:w-auto snap-center flex items-center gap-3 p-3 md:p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80"
      >
        <div
          class="w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-200/70 text-[#1a3a5c] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-base md:text-lg"
        >
          📲
        </div>
        <div class="text-left">
          <h4
            class="text-[13px] md:text-[13.5px] font-black text-[#1a3a5c] leading-tight"
          >
            Sem digitar aluno por aluno
          </h4>
          <p
            class="hidden md:block text-[12px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5 leading-snug"
          >
            Mande o link no WhatsApp e os pais cadastram em 2 minutos.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="flex-none w-[70%] sm:w-[50%] md:w-auto snap-center flex items-center gap-3 p-3 md:p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80"
      >
        <div
          class="w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-200/70 text-[#1a3a5c] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-base md:text-lg"
        >
          🤝
        </div>
        <div class="text-left">
          <h4
            class="text-[13px] md:text-[13.5px] font-black text-[#1a3a5c] leading-tight"
          >
            Fácil como o WhatsApp
          </h4>
          <p
            class="hidden md:block text-[12px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5 leading-snug"
          >
            Funciona direto no seu celular com suporte humano para te
            ajudar.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
